- The father declares 
\f1\i "God will see to a sheep as a whole burnt offering for himself" 
\f2\i0 (NETS)
\f1\i , which Brenton prints, 
\f2\i0 "God will provide himself a sheep for a whole-burnt-offering, my son"
\f1\i  \'97 the very title John the Baptist will give Jesus: 
\f3\b "\uc0\u7988 \u948 \u949  \u8001  \u7936 \u956 \u957 \u8056 \u962  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u920 \u949 \u959 \u8166 "
\f1\b0  
\f2\i0 (behold, the Lamb of God)* (John 1:29).\

