\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Psalm 2:6-7 (LXX):\
\pard\pardeftab720\li831\fi-832\sa200\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs33\fsmilli16667 \cf0 "But I was established king by him, on Sion 
\f1\i (Zion)
\f2\i0 , his holy mountain, by proclaiming the Lord\'92s ordinance: The Lord said to me, "My son you are; today I have begotten you." \'97 
\f0\b Psalm 2:6-7, LXX (NETS)
\f2\b0 \
