\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 Acts 13:32-33 (Geneva):
\f2\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\li831\fi-832\sa200\partightenfactor0

\fs33\fsmilli16667 \cf0 And we declare unto you, that touching the promise made unto the fathers, God hath fulfilled it unto us their children, in that he raised vp Jesus, even as it is written in the second Psalm, Thou art my Son: this day have I begotten thee. \'97 
