\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Psalm 2:8 (LXX):\
\pard\pardeftab720\li831\fi-832\sa200\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs33\fsmilli16667 \cf0 Ask of me, and I will give you nations as your heritage, and as your possession the ends of the earth. \'97 
