\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Observation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 The Son 
\f0\b asks
\f2\b0 ; the Father 
\f0\b gives
\f2\b0 . This is the consistent pattern: the Father is the Source (
\f0\b \uc0\u7952 \u958  \u959 \u8023 
\f2\b0 , 1 Cor 8:6), the Son is the Recipient and Agent. The nations are 
\f0\b given
\f2\b0  to the Son as an inheritance \'97 He does not possess them by inherent right of independent deity; they are 
