\f0\b \cf0 Matthew 28:18 (Geneva):
\f2\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\li831\fi-832\sa200\partightenfactor0

\fs33\fsmilli16667 \cf0 And Jesus came, and spake unto them, saying, All power is given unto me, in heaven, and in earth. \'97 
\f0\b Matthew 28:18, 1599 Geneva
\f2\b0 \
