\f2\b0\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 1. He is 
\f0\b distinct from
\f2\b0  the Lord \'97 He is 
\f1\i the Lord's
\f2\i0  Christ (v. 2).\
2. He is 
\f0\b installed
\f2\b0  as King by the Father (v. 6).\
3. He is 
\f0\b begotten
\f2\b0  of the Father on a definite day \'97 fulfilled at His 
