\f0\b with
\f2\b0  the Lord at the creation. This is precisely the language John 1:1 will echo: 
\f0\b \uc0\u8001  \u923 \u972 \u947 \u959 \u962  \u7974 \u957  \u960 \u961 \u8056 \u962  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u920 \u949 \u972 \u957 
