\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 What Proverbs 8 establishes about the Son:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 1. He is 
\f0\b brought forth / founded
