\f0\b The Father's wisdom
\f2\b0  is His 
\f0\b plan of salvation through the crucified Christ
\f2\b0  \'97 which appears foolish to the Greeks and a scandal to the Jews.\
- 
\f0\b To those who are called
\f2\b0 , the crucified Christ 
\f1\i is
\f2\i0  
\f0\b the power and wisdom OF God
\f2\b0  \'97 that is, 
\f0\b the Father's power and the Father's wisdom embodied / enacted in Him
\f2\b0 .\
The phrase 
\f0\b \uc0\u920 \u949 \u959 \u8166  \u963 \u959 \u966 \u943 \u945 \u957 
\f2\b0  is a 
\f0\b genitive of source/possession
\f2\b0 : 
\f3\i\b God's
\f2\i0\b0  
\f0\b wisdom
\f2\b0  \'97 wisdom 
\f0\b belonging to the Father
\f2\b0 , manifested 
\f0\b in
\f2\b0  the crucified Christ. It is not saying "Christ is a personified pre-existent Wisdom-being." It is saying: 
