\f0\b\fs40 \cf0 The Retraction\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 I therefore must retract my use of 1 Corinthians 1:24, 30 as a witness identifying Christ with the personified Wisdom of Proverbs 8.\
What Paul is saying:\
- 
\f0\b The Father is wise
\f2\b0  (the Source of all true wisdom).\
- 
\f0\b The Father's wisdom is displayed in the cross of Christ
\f2\b0  \'97 a wisdom the world rejects.\
- 
\f0\b Christ has been made to us wisdom from God
\f2\b0  \'97 meaning, the Father has appointed Christ to be the embodiment of His saving plan 
\f0\b for our benefit
\f2\b0 .\
What Paul is 
\f0\b not
\f2\b0  saying:\
- That Christ is ontologically identical with the 
\f0\b \uc0\u931 \u959 \u966 \u943 \u945 
\f2\b0  personified in Proverbs 8.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
