\f0\b\fs40 \cf0 John 1: The Prologue\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 John 1:1-18 \'97 the Prologue \'97 is perhaps the most cited, most contested, and most assumed-upon passage in the entire NT regarding the identity of Christ. Let us approach it with strict discipline under our maxims.\
Per our second maxim, I cannot establish anything from John 1 
\f1\i alone
\f2\i0  \'97 every doctrine requires two or more witnesses. So as we examine, we will note what John says and then ask: 
\f1\i does Scripture establish this same point elsewhere?
\f2\i0 \
Let us proceed phrase by phrase.\
