\f0\b \cf0 What the text strictly says:
\f2\b0 \
- The phrase 
\f0\b \uc0\u7960 \u957  \u7936 \u961 \u967 \u8135 
\f2\b0  is the same as Genesis 1:1 LXX. John is deliberately echoing Genesis.\
- 
\f0\b \uc0\u7974 \u957 
\f2\b0  is imperfect \'97 
\f1\i "was [existing/being]"
