\cf0 #### 
\f0\b Phrase 2: \uc0\u954 \u945 \u8054  \u8001  \u923 \u972 \u947 \u959 \u962  \u7974 \u957  \u960 \u961 \u8056 \u962  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u920 \u949 \u972 \u957 
