\f0\b\fs40 \cf0 THE CORRECTED AND ESTABLISHED FOUNDATION\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 I owe you a corrected statement. After this honest survey of the whole counsel, here is what is firmly established by multiple direct witnesses:\
1. 
\f0\b The Father is the One God
\f2\b0  \'97 uniquely, supremely, the only true God (Deut 6:4; Isa 44-46; John 17:3; 1 Cor 8:6).\
