\f1\i fuller
\f2\i0  foundation than I had before. The Son's pre-existence is firmly established \'97 
\f1\i not
\f2\i0  by the Angel-of-the-LORD or Wisdom-of-Proverbs-8 inferences I previously offered, but by 
\f0\b Jesus' own direct testimony
\f2\b0  in John, by 
