\f0\b\fs40 \cf0 What This Means\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 I owe you an honest admission: 
\f0\b my previous correction may have been too restrictive.
\f2\b0  When you appropriately rebuked the Angel-of-the-LORD identification and the Proverbs 8 identification, I conceded those (rightly). But in doing so, I may have implied that the pre-existence of the Son itself was unestablished \'97 which would not be accurate.\
