\f2\b0\fs33\fsmilli16667 \cf0 And they that passed by, reviled him, wagging their heads ... Likewise also the high Priests mocking him, with the Scribes and Elders, and Pharises, said, He saved others, but he cannot save ... He trusted in God, let him deliver him now, if he will have him. \'97 
\f0\b Matthew 27:39-43, 1599 Geneva
