\f0\b "He trusted in God; let Him deliver Him if He will have Him"
\f2\b0  \'97 are nearly a verbatim quotation of Psalm 21:8 LXX. The Synoptic writers, by inspiration, record the historical mocking and the prophetic word matching it. 
\f0\b Two witnesses (Matthew and the Psalmist) testify to the same event.
\f2\b0 \
