\fs36 \cf0 NETS:\
\pard\pardeftab720\li831\fi-832\sa200\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs33\fsmilli16667 \cf0 Like water I was poured out, and all my bones were scattered; my heart became like wax melting within my belly; my strength was dried up like a potsherd, and my tongue is stuck to my throat, and to death\'92s dust you brought me down, \'97 
\f0\b Psalm 21:14-15 LXX (22:14-15 MT), NETS
