\f0\b "I thirst"
\f2\b0  was 
\f0\b "that the Scripture might be fulfilled."
\f2\b0  Psalm 21:15 LXX speaks of His tongue cleaving to His jaws. John binds Jesus' suffering directly to this prophetic Psalm.\
