\f2\b0\fs33\fsmilli16667 \cf0 All the ends of the earth shall remember and turn to the Lord, and all the paternal families of the nations shall do obeisance 
\f1\i (worship)
\f2\i0  before him, because kingship is the Lord\'92s, and it is he who is master over the nations. \'97 
\f0\b Psalm 21:27-28 LXX (22:27-28 MT), NETS
\f2\b0 \
