\f0\b nations turning to the LORD
\f2\b0  and worshipping \'97 the global outcome of the Son's suffering. This is consistent with Ps 2:8 (
\f1\i "the nations as Thine inheritance"
\f2\i0 ) and with the worldwide proclamation of the Gospel.\
