\f0\b PART TWO: ISAIAH 52:13 \'97 53:12 \'97 The Suffering Servant
\f2\b0 \
This is 
\f0\b the most extensive and explicit prophecy of the Son's atoning death in the OT.
\f2\b0  We must take it slowly.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
