\f0\b\fs40 \cf0 Isaiah 53:2-3 LXX \'97 The Servant Despised\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa360\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf0 NETS:\
\pard\pardeftab720\li831\fi-832\sa200\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs33\fsmilli16667 \cf0 He grew up before him like a child, like a root in a thirsty land; he has no form or glory, and we saw him, and he had no form or beauty. But his form was without honor, failing beyond all men, a man being in calamity and knowing how to bear sickness; because his face is turned away, he was dishonored and not esteemed. \'97 
\f0\b Isaiah 53:2-3 LXX, NETS
\f2\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa360\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Observations\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 (1)
\f2\b0  
\f0\b \uc0\u8033 \u962  \u960 \u945 \u953 \u948 \u943 \u959 \u957  \u7952 \u957 \u945 \u957 \u964 \u943 \u959 \u957  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166 
\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i "as a little child before Him."
\f2\i0  The Servant grows up before the LORD as a tender shoot \'97 a humble origin.\

\f0\b (2)
\f2\b0  
\f0\b \uc0\u8033 \u962  \u8165 \u943 \u950 \u945  \u7952 \u957  \u947 \u8135  \u948 \u953 \u968 \u974 \u963 \u8131 
\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i "as a root in thirsty ground."
\f2\i0  This corresponds to 
\f0\b Rev 22:16
\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i "I am the Root..."
\f2\i0  \'97 and 
\f0\b Rev 5:5
\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i "the Root of David."
\f2\i0  The Servant's origin is humble, from dry earth, not from royal display.\

\f0\b (3)
\f2\b0  
\f0\b \uc0\u7940 \u957 \u952 \u961 \u969 \u960 \u959 \u962  \u7952 \u957  \u960 \u955 \u951 \u947 \u8135  \u8034 \u957 
\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i "a Man in suffering."
\f2\i0  The Servant is repeatedly identified as 
\f0\b a Man.
\f2\b0  No hidden Deity unrecognizable as human \'97 He is genuinely Man in suffering.\

\f0\b (4)
\f2\b0  
\f0\b \uc0\u7968 \u964 \u953 \u956 \u940 \u963 \u952 \u951  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u959 \u8016 \u954  \u7952 \u955 \u959 \u947 \u943 \u963 \u952 \u951 
\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i "He was dishonored and not esteemed."
\f2\i0  Fulfilled in Jesus' rejection by His own people (John 1:11).\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
