\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Observations of supreme importance\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 (1)
\f2\b0  
\f0\b \uc0\u948 \u953 \u8125  \u7975 \u962  \u7952 \u947 \u947 \u943 \u950 \u959 \u956 \u949 \u957  \u964 \u8183  \u920 \u949 \u8183 
\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i "by which we draw near unto God."
\f2\i0  The purpose of the new priesthood is 
\f0\b access to God [the Father].
\f2\b0  The Son's priestly ministry is 
\f0\b for our access to the Father
