\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Observation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 The New Covenant
\f2\b0  has these features:\
- 
\f0\b Internalized
\f2\b0  law (in the mind and on the heart).\
- 
\f0\b God is their God; they are His people
\f2\b0  (covenant relation restored).\
- 
\f0\b Forgiveness of sins
\f2\b0  with no further remembrance.\

\f0\b The Son's high-priestly ministry is the ministry of this New Covenant.
\f2\b0  He is its 
\f0\b guarantor
\f2\b0  (Heb 7:22) and its 
\f0\b mediator
\f2\b0  (Heb 8:6, 9:15, 12:24).\
