\f1\i\b0\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 "And every Priest standeth daily ministering, and oft times offereth one manner of offering, which can never take away sins: But this man after he had offered one sacrifice for sins, sitteth for ever at the right hand of God, And from hencefoorth tarieth, till his enemies be made his footestoole. For with one offering hath he consecrated 
