\f1\i\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 (the draft\'92s \'93that Son of man\'94 reads the Geneva\'92s \'93the Son of man\'94 \'97 recorded on the bank row when this confession was seated; the draft\'92s Greek block keeps \uc0\u952 \u961 \u972 \u957 \u8179 /\u957 \u949 \u966 \u949 \u955 \u8182 \u957  load-bearing terms in the observations below, and its wording checked word-for-word against the whole-span Greek this wave)
\f2\i0 \
