\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Observation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa346\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf0 Jesus' confession before the high priest combines:\
- 
\f0\b Psalm 110:1
\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i "sitting at the right hand of power"
\f2\i0 \
- 
\f0\b Daniel 7:13
\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i "coming on the clouds of heaven"
\f2\i0 \
These two Old Testament texts form the 
\f0\b double pillar
