\f0\b \uc0\u954 \u972 \u968 \u959 \u957 \u964 \u945 \u953  \u7952 \u960 \u8125  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u8056 \u957 
\f2\b0  \'97 
\f1\i "they shall mourn for 
\f3\b Him
\f1\b0 "
\f2\i0  (third person).\

