\f0\b what is done to the Son is felt by the Father.
\f2\b0  The piercing of the Son is the piercing of the Father in some real sense \'97 yet the Son is distinct (mourned 
\f1\i as a beloved Son
\f2\i0 , 
\f1\i as a firstborn
\f2\i0 ).\
