\f0\b (2)
\f2\b0  
\f0\b The trumpet of God
\f2\b0  \'97 corresponds with Matt 24:31 and 1 Cor 15:52.\

\f0\b (3)
\f2\b0  
\f0\b \uc0\u954 \u945 \u8054  \u959 \u8021 \u964 \u969 \u962  \u960 \u940 \u957 \u964 \u959 \u964 \u949  \u963 \u8058 \u957  \u922 \u965 \u961 \u943 \u8179  \u7952 \u963 \u972 \u956 \u949 \u952 \u945 
