\f0\b\fs40 \cf0 2 Peter 3:10 \'97 The Day of the LORD as a Thief\
\pard\pardeftab720\li831\fi-832\sa200\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs33\fsmilli16667 \cf0 But the day of the Lord will come as a thief in the night, in the which the heavens shall pass away with a noise, and the elements shall melt with heat, and the earth with the works that are therein, shall be burnt up.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa360\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Observation\
